 "remarks": "Beautiful, Spacious 1-bedroom Residence at The Biltmore Luxury Condominium. Relax with 24/7 Concierge Luxury Living. Modern One Level Condo In The Heart Of Downtown. Views of Lovely Courtyard-Park. Large Condo has Wood floors in All Rooms. Freshly Painted Walls with Sophisticated Designer color. Kitchen with appliances. Updated with desirable Walk-In-Shower in Bathroom. The Biltmore amenities include 24/7 concierge, large fitness center, lounge, and access to 4th flr courtyard. Across from Stamford Town Center Mall w/ Macy's, Pickleball America, Restaurants, NY Comedy etc. Rentals Allowed with 60-day minimum. Stamford Train Station is less than 1 mile.  Rent Parking from attached garage company ~$120/month. Move-in ready. Experience downtown living at its best.",
